From: Numerio <b.vitruvio@gmail.com>
Subject: do not treat warnings as errors
Forwarded: not-needed
Description:
 The current Debian compiler reports new warnings on the legacy sources
 (e.g. "variable 'angle_sum' set but not used" in HSPolygon.cpp), and
 -Werror turns each of them into a build failure.
Author: Numerio <b.vitruvio@gmail.com>

--- a/Makefile
+++ b/Makefile
@@ -156,7 +156,7 @@
 DEBUGGER =
 
 #	specify additional compiler flags for all files
-COMPILER_FLAGS = -Werror
+COMPILER_FLAGS =
 
 #	specify additional linker flags
 LINKER_FLAGS =
